# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Green Turtle Kava — store checkout
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The /checkout flow creates a Stripe Checkout Session server-side and redirects
# the customer to Stripe's hosted, PCI-compliant payment page. Set your Stripe
# SECRET key here for local dev, and add it as an Environment Variable in Vercel
# for production. Never commit the real key.
#
# Test key looks like:  sk_test_...        Live key looks like:  sk_live_...
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_replace_me
